* **Shortness of Breath & Medications:** *"I've been experiencing shortness of breath. Could my current medications (omeprazole, calcium, vitamin D) be contributing to this? Also, can we review my asthma treatment plan to ensure I am on the correct medications?"*
* **Joint Pain & Imaging:** *"I've been having more frequent joint pain. Can we discuss the MRI that my GP ordered? Was it ordered to investigate my joint pain, and what are we looking for?"*
* **Specialist Referrals:** *"Could you help me understand the primary goal of my referral to Seattle Heart and how it ties into my current symptoms?"*

If you would like, I can use the `draft_email` tool to format these questions into an email draft to send to Dr. Foster or Dr. Kim ahead of your appointment. Just let me know their email address!

